   "subject": "Supressing \"estimate only\" message",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Is it currently possible to suppress the message &quot;estimate only: convert difftimes to intervals for accuracy&quot; when executing something like the following line?</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:20px;background-color:rgb(251,251,251)\">as.period(ymd(&quot;2010-01-01&quot;) - ymd(&quot;2009-11-01&quot;)) #From </span><font color=\"#777777\" face=\"Helvetica, arial, freesans, clean, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:20px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/issues/75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/issues/75&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235799974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RYMBzPBM5vRINe92kTHCY\">https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/issues/75</a></span></font><br></div><div><br></div><div>Is there a way to suppress this specific message, without suppressing more important warnings that may occur?</div><div><br></div><div>If not, would t be helpful if I forked lubridate and modified <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r#L188-L191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r%23L188-L191&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235799974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HETchHQt2xsCBT7EFbhGp\">this method</a> from</div><div><pre style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:16px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">setMethod<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;as.period&quot;</span><span>,</span> signature<span>(</span>x <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;difftime&quot;</span><span>),</span> <span>function</span><span>(</span>x<span>,</span> unit <span>=</span> <span>NULL</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">...</span><span>){</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">  message<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;estimate only: convert difftimes to intervals for accuracy&quot;</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">  seconds_to_period<span>(</span>as.double<span>(</span>x<span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;secs&quot;</span><span>))</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\"><span>})</span></div></pre></div><div><br></div><div>to something like</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:16px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">setMethod<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;as.period&quot;</span><span>,</span> signature<span>(</span>x <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;difftime&quot;</span><span>),</span> <span>function</span><span>(</span>x<span>,</span> unit <span>=</span> <span>NULL</span><span>,</span> <b>showAccuracyWarning=TRUE, </b><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">...</span><span>){</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">  <b>if( showAccuracyWarning )</b> message<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;estimate only: convert difftimes to intervals for accuracy&quot;</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">  seconds_to_period<span>(</span>as.double<span>(</span>x<span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;secs&quot;</span><span>))</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\"><span>})</span></div></pre></div><div>?</div><div><br></div><div>To make the signatures and behavior consistent, I suppose these two lines show be modified as well.</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r#L370\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r%23L370&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235799974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QfA_bxRzNKt4StC_EwQ56\">https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r#L370</a></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r#L436\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r%23L436&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235799974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lzCOnyRhUasV0CKuCVojw\">https://github.com/hadley/lubridate/blob/95418730b7beff3508f7044a4ce11326167afc81/R/coercion.r#L436</a></div><div><br></div>I really like the period concept in lubridate.  I deal with human age a lot, such as if kids were eligible for a specific government program during a past event.  The period `10y 0m 1d` is more accurate/appropriate than dividing a difftime of 3653 days by 365.25.  It&#39;s even more important when the eligibility threshold is 6 months or 34 months old."
    ]
   ]
